WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.080
I can't believe this...

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.870
I mean, this is so sudden.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.940
What's going to happen now?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.370
What can you expect to happen...

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.650
...it's already a decided matter.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:38.540
Shimojii, you traitor!!!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.980
Look, turn around now

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.320
but things like chances won't be there anymore.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.780
That's what some people will tell you,

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:03.040
but there are just times when you can't move at all.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.510
Yes, everything I say

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:16.970
is for your sake.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.470
Sorry, but

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.760
I won't consent easily

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:27.650
to things I don't accept.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:34.650
Even if I can get by that moment with a lie

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.740
I'll end up regretting it afterwards.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.530
Whether it's the past or the future

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.620
or, of course, the present,

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.040
I am the one that has to shoulder it.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:51.710
You'll understand the meaning to everything afterwards.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.330
So let's worry!

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:55.970
even if you don't understand them now,

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:00.640
whether it has to do with pain, fortune or secrets.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.020
So don't cry, let's hold each other as we go

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.520
forever-

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:14.280
It's My Life

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:14.280
because it's my life.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:12.980
last frame of Manabi Straight! logo

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:20.120
Umm...

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.280
And so,

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:26.580
our Seioh High School will be merging with Aikoh High School.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:32.200
Many of the details have not been decided yet and may not be announced...

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.190
...but we will take up the responsibility to...

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.190
Wh-What's this all about?

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:37.660
...make the transition as good as we can for the students.

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:35.350
Like I'd know!

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.640
Concurrent administration, probably.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.120
But this is pretty sudden.

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.690
So everyone, please rest assured...

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:42.190
...and put your efforts in your studies like you have been.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.950
With this merger,

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.790
we have a sad announcement
to make about the School Fair.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.270
I understand that you're angry.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:57.300
But, it's not just the cancellation of the School Fair,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:01.430
we teachers didn't even know about
the whole merger until today at the ceremony.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.710
Let's calm down a bit and talk-

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:04.990
Oww, oww, oww...

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:05.960
Give up?

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.300
Give, give, give, give!

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.240
Continue.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.460
I'm going to break it!

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.230
Ow, ow, ow!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.000
Do it!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:13.480
Stop!!!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.930
That is quite enough.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.070
Principal!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.760
I take full responsibility for all this.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.750
Even though the number of students has been decreasing,

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.700
we didn't do anything special to change, and things have come to this.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:31.860
While other schools focused on allowing students to get employed at prestigious companies...

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.430
...or have focused on specializing in obtaining certifications...

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.910
...I have sat down and insisted on tradition...

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.210
...being nostalgic about the past.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.250
As the administration deteriorated down to this point,

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.620
I was not able to take any action.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.830
I was a Student Council President, too.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.440
I'm sorry.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.370
I don't think that would be possible.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.230
Please don't say that; I beg you!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.070
Taka-chan, go ask your Superintendent, too!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.200
We'll go, too!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.680
Please? Please?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.120
To be honest,

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:27.100
I knew about today's announcement
beforehand from the Superintendent.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.360
I couldn't tell you.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:30.860
Forgive me.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.040
I have tried to persuade the Superintendent many times about the School Fair already,

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:39.130
but it was all in vain,

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.530
I just learned about
the School Fair being cancelled; that's it.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.840
I'm really sorry.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:49.860
Thank you.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.010
You tried to step in for us, right?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.570
So, thank you.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:00.730
Thank you.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.260
Bye then.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:12.740
Okay.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.800
And so!

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:19.990
My fellow students.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.770
I love this school,

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.960
and this school that I love, because of extremely shallow administrative decisions,

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.810
has come to a situation where it has no choice but to be merged with other schools.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.040
The rapidly decreasing child birth rate,

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.200
the transition of ideologies,

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:34.920
the changes in societal circumstances, and etc.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:38.670
All these aspects that surround and worsen our school's environment should be accounted for, as well,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.900
but our "reminiscent doctrine",

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.050
what our conservative educational environment's decadent thinking has given birth to...

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.960
...and obstructs our future, is the reason we have collapsed. Isn't that what the M&A school is telling us?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.570
The administration is trying to impose a part of that responsibility on us.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:54.200
They are forgetting about
their indolent thoughts and actions,

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.620
sugarcoating their vested rights and profits with flowery words like "for the survival of the school",

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:01.990
and plotting to cancel
our School Fair with all these lies!

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.290
What is it that we want?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.790
Not an apology!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.000
Not a compromise!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:13.820
Our School Fair.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.540
Yes, our School Fair!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.720
A great person once said this:

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:20.780
"Leave our posts and leave the city."

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.560
Another person said this:

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.770
"Look, look, these are my bones."

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:28.550
And after an intensive battle, a young boy said this:

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:32.010
"I still have a place to go back to."

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.690
What we want isn't delicious food...

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.800
...or clothing that overnight millionaires fund with their allowances.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.300
We want our School Fair!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:45.010
We desire our exciting and wonderful School Fair!

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:50.400
Let's make our School Fair the greatest School Fair, the Great School Fair of the 21st century!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:56.140
The Great School Fair that has creativity and innovation that one couldn't imagine even a second ago!

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:02.190
Let us become the All-School Fair Fighting Union that represents the entire student body of Seioh High School...

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:05.730
...and stand up against all obstacles and conspiracies!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.360
We, the Student Council,

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:13.070
against this one-sided and tyrannical request of canceling the School Fair the administration has put forth,

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.990
declare that we will stubbornly and firmly...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.080
...fight against this until the very, very end!

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.410
Re-volt!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:20.970
Re-volt!

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:21.780
Re-volt!

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:22.670
Re-volt!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.660
TAKE 'EM DOWN!!!

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:26.350
Re-volt!

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:26.890
Re-volt!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:27.710
Re-volt!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.280
Re-volt!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.020
Re-volt!

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:29.610
Re-volt!

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.180
Re-volt!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:30.810
Re-volt!

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.910
Oh, she's going for it!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:41.720
Ouch!

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:45.240
For now,

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:50.580
I've requested an appointment with Aikoh High School's Superintendent through the Principal.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.230
Nice, Mei-chan!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:53.330
Mei's the best!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.200
And one more thing.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:56.330
I made something like this.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.840
"Please don't cancel...

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.470
...our School Fair"?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.850
We need a petition campaign!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:20.440
I'm sure we're not the only ones that are disappointed by this announcement.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.240
We need to bring in everyone's voice!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.300
If the voices for making them take back the decision of canceling the School Fair are high,

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.300
then we'd be able to rally under one flag to fight against them!

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.530
If we could change the structure of this confrontation...

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:10.890
...from "Student Council v. Aikoh High School's decision"...

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.790
...to "Public opinion v. Aikoh High School's decision"...

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:20.460
Let's revive the School Fair with our own hands!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.980
The School Fair was our very own festival.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:28.330
That festival has been one-sidedly and suddenly cancelled without any consultation with us.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.800
This is just wrong! Cruel!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.800
We can change this cancellation with our own hands!

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.930
After coming all this way,

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.440
I'm not going to let this get cancelled!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.760
Let us fight together!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.940
With our own hands!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.590
If you care even just a little bit,

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.970
please sign our petition!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.570
Let's make them take back the cancellation of our School Fair!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.320
We need all of your help!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.540
Things are going smooth, smooth!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:57.080
At this rate, we can revive the School Fair in no time!

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.010
Yeah!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.730
Then, to celebrate the fight that our school put up,

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:02.390
let's go party at Ajihana!

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:03.550
Agreed!

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.630
The Ajihana dinner we had that night...

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.050
...was more delicious and happier than usual, but...

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.980
Gosh!

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.190
Why?!

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.570
Contrary our predictions,

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:31.070
our petition campaign quickly lost momentum.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.840
Hey, hey, are you going to come to the dance event in front of the train station this weekend?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.960
I don't know yet.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.770
What's the matter?

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.090
A series of uncharacteristic plays from you, Mu-chi.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:04.900
Sorry.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:05.720
Fight-o!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:10.010
But honestly, it's a relief for us that the School Fair got cancelled.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:14.120
After all, helper Mu-chi-sama is Seioh Athletic's star-

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:16.800
S-Sorry...

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.200
It's okay.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.260
Bye.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.150
I'm home.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:56.120
Wow, even Oniichan has a girlfriend...

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.650
A cheerful topic to talk about in these dark times!

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.710
Can never underestimate this guy...

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:01.560
You son of a gun!

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.930
That hurts, Manabi.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:03.790
You son of a gun!

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:04.410
You son of a gun!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.280
You son of a gun!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.740
Manabi, that hurts.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:12.090
Please take care of my inexperienced brother.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:18.830
Kiyokawa Kyoko.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.970
Pleased to meet you, Manabi-san.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.050
Yes, same here.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.870
Hm, how do you know my name?

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:29.070
So, what do you do for work?

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:31.570
I serve as Superintendent for Aikoh High School.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.410
What?

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:37.810
Superintendent for Aikoh High School.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:49.390
Let me stay here from now on.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.640
Manabi-san got angry.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.820
I didn't know about this at all.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.630
Is it going to be a blow to our relationship?

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.870
There's no point in saying that.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:04.200
I can't help the fact that I'm in love with you already.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.300
How sweet of you, Takefumi-kun.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.860
Hey, what kind of a person is Manabi-san?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.000
What kind?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.720
She's had to move around all over
the place because of our parents' work.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.070
She might be a bit weird.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.580
What kind of places has she been to?

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.630
Umm...

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.770
Lebanon, Cambodia, Malaysia, Guiana,

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:32.220
Madagascar, Israel, Tibet, Tonga,

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.010
then...

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.740
Sh-She's pretty well-travelled, isn't she?

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:39.220
Her personality allows her to make lots of friends,

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.090
so I'm sure she's doing fine.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.810
But since she transfers away immediately, all those things get reset.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:49.170
So, I think school is a very important place for her.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:52.360
Though, she's probably not aware of that.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.780
Gosh!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:58.400
Why did Oniichan's girlfriend have to be Aikoh's Superintendent of all people?!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.970
Wow, they met at an astrophysics conference?

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:03.830
That's so romantic.

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.360
That's so NOT romantic AT ALL.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.660
Y-You think so?

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.310
Oniichan looked so mellow.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.190
And the girl's eight years older than him.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:15.940
Besides,

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.910
she knew I was Seioh High School's Student Council President!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:23.850
Yet, she didn't say anything about the School Fair to Oniichan!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:26.290
M-Manabi-chan, calm down.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:29.380
Here's what I think; she's a vixen.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.710
An evil vixen spirit has possessed her.

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.680
Now, I have to...

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.900
Manabi-chan?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:37.460
I'm sure Kyoko-san has her own situation.

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:42.240
And your oniisan's relationship with Kyoko-san is a separate matter from the School Fair.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.140
Good night, Manabi-chan.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.160
Yes.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.790
So, I shall send her over today after school.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.020
That'd be okay, right?

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.790
Yes, goodbye.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.970
Please excuse us.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.880
"The cancellation of the School Fair is a set matter."

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.180
"There's no need to meet."

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.030
...that was the one-sided situation,

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.150
but what made them change their minds?

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.650
Well, it's exactly what we wanted.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:25.300
By the way, Amamiya,

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.500
you sure you don't need me to accompany you?

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.030
Yes, for this is a personal issue.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:36.170
Aikoh's Superintendent was apparently willing to listen to what we had to say.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:44.090
Will Manabi-chan be all right?

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.820
It had been two months since Manabi-chan transferred.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.980
The nomination for Student Council President...

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.410
The renovation of the Student Council office...

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.480
These two months had been wave after wave of events.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.660
What's going to happen from here on?

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:20.840
I can only do what I can do.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.140
Things will be okay, right?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.750
Things will work out, right?

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:28.710
Manabi-chan.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.190
Sorry about yesterday.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.190
Did it bother you?

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:41.240
Takefumi-kun was worried sick,
so please go back home as soon as possible, okay?

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.970
Gosh, Takefumi-kun is so sweet.

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:51.790
Youngsters these days are so obvious in "making kindness part of their repertoire" that it just annoys me,

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.830
but Takefumi-kun's is genuine!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.220
Gosh, he's so cute.

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.210
So cute, I want to eat him up.

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.570
Why you!!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.240
You vile vixen!

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:05.570
I'll n-n-n-n-never admit your relationship with Oniichan!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.490
Wh-Why you-

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.930
Eat him?! Is your brain screwed up-

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.330
Let's get down to business.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:12.370
You want me to take back the cancellation of the School Fair.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.930
That's what you're here for, right?

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.690
Yes, that's right.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:17.560
And why?

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:19.020
That's MY question!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.980
It was going to be the best School Fair ever!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.190
Why are you canceling it?!

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:27.820
Because it's just a little fun event that has nothing to do with the duty of students.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.820
I object! I object, your Honor!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.560
To throw out the term "duty of students" without getting any criticisms...

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.710
...is just wrong in my opinion!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.010
That may be.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.320
Then let us assume your School Fair is really a new possibility...

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:44.630
...that can bring a new side to what the duty of students should be.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:48.890
But I still think the cancellation of
the School Fair was the right decision to make.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:49.890
Why?!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:55.600
Because I don't hear other students saying, "Please don't cancel our School Fair".

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.230
Why? Why?

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:01.200
Because it's already set and done.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.360
We can change that!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.950
Weren't you looking forward to the School Fair?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.660
I was, but...

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.590
But, see, there's a dance event in front of the train station next week.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.120
There are plenty of other fun events.

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.980
You don't have to be so stubborn about the School Fair.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:17.670
Right?

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.660
"We have to do the School Fair."

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.650
"There's a need to do it."

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:27.410
Isn't the Student Council the only one that thinks that way?

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.900
Gosh.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.290
Excuse me.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.730
Superintendent,

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.070
the talk...

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.300
It just ended.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:12.170
Is it going to be cancelled?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:13.950
I don't know.

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.560
Whether the School Fair will be cancelled...

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.510
...or whether it will be revived...

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.640
it's up to Manabi-san and her Student Council.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.390
What does that mean-

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.150
Sorry.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:26.750
Hello?

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.570
Ah, Takefumi-kun!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.610
Don't worry so much; it's all right!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.980
I told her to go home,

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.640
so don't let out such a worrisome voice.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:40.490
You'll make me sad, too.

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.490
Should I poke fun at her?

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.500
...or something like that!

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.470
Ah, Manabi.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:46.340
How did it go?

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:53.630
It's getting cancelled...

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:54.550
...After all?

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:09.690
I won't let you.

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:12.950
I won't...

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.900
I won't let you cancel the School Fair!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.440
You're just like a child.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.250
You make all kinds of noise if your wish isn't granted.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.250
Very well.

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:32.090
If you're going to go that far,
I will give you guys one chance.

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.040
70 percent.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.600
The petition to appeal the decision of the School Fair.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:48.630
Gather at least 70 percent of all students' signatures on the petition within one week...

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:49.430
...Eh?

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:58.060
Prove that your School Fair is something everyone really wishes for...

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:58.860
...Eh?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:00.530
What an unreasonable request.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.470
But...

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.930
Our chances aren't zero.

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:08.070
The School Fair that all of our buddies are creating...

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.630
...will definitely be fun!

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.750
They should all be able to understand this!

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:14.330
People...

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:16.760
We don't have much time,

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:17.890
but are you guys ready?

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.430
Then, let's go!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:17.300
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.050
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:30.980
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:38.520
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:47.800
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:55.010
so thank you, God.

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:03.310
I want to treasure my luck right now

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.610
And stay happy on the way.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:10.450
Come on, let's ride on the momentum

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.240
Bang！Bang！Bang！

00:23:13.300 --> 00:23:15.410
That's right, Lucky!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:19.000
Now is the time, happy!

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.130
Grab your chances

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.300
And live your lives to the fullest...
